Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 14:17:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 013/140] fix(audio): support light-mode visualizers

Use transparent GL surfaces and contrast-aware Material and artwork tones for visualizers and the seekbar ribbon. Expand the visualizer stage, retain background-free bottom fades, and fix the Scopes sheet composable title call.
